Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 03:25:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat(core): report Aadhaar-like number positions for
 image redaction (PRV-016, ADR-0007)

find_aadhaar(text) returns every 12-digit window mask_aadhaar masks (Verhoeff-valid, or
near an Aadhaar keyword) with its character range, ASCII digits and checksum flag, so a
caller can map numbers to OCR bounding boxes. Same rules as the masking pass (one shared
window scan); core stays pure.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
